# UX workflow: cancel an audible destination-first LFO audition.
# Purpose: proves Back means exact Cancel and returns to the same empty
# assignment surface with no visible source residue.
# Expect: capture_changed:lfo_audition_default=lfo_audition_changed, capture_changed:lfo_audition_changed=modulation_restored
# Expect: semantic:lfo_audition_default:projection=audible_audition, semantic:lfo_audition_changed:effect=edit_lfo_shape, semantic:modulation_restored:effect=cancel_lfo_audition

0 scenario macro
80 capture screen macro_ready

180 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
260 tap MACRO_1 60
1240 tick
1300 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
1450 encoder NAV 1
1570 encoder NAV 1
1690 tap NAV 60
1810 tap NAV 60
2030 capture screen lfo_audition_default

2150 encoder OPT 1.00
2370 capture screen lfo_audition_changed

# LEFT_TOP is local Back/Cancel; it does not close the parent Macro editor.
2490 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2710 capture screen modulation_restored
